  <name>ComputeSec</name>
  <summary>Evaluate firmware, kernel hardening, hardware vendor and usage habits</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="zh_CN">评估固件安全、内核加固、硬件品牌与使用习惯</summary>
  <developer id="uk._92li.lingyicute">
    <name>lingyicute</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>ComputeSec is a friendly GTK4/libadwaita assistant that helps you turn a Linux machine into a trustworthy computing environment.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Dashboard with an overall security score</li>
      <li>fwupd Host Security ID (HSI) results with plain-language explanations and a “You can fix” section</li>
      <li>Kernel command line and sysctl hardening comparison with copy-and-paste fixes</li>
      <li>Hardware vendor reputation database (Superfish, ShadowHammer, Boot Guard key leaks, etc.)</li>
      <li>Usage habits: Flatpak adoption, uptime, 2.4G wireless receivers, NTFS/Windows presence</li>
    </ul>
    <p>All checks run locally and never upload data. Results that need root privileges are collected via a step-by-step wizard that reads from the clipboard, without requesting invasive permissions like flatpak-spawn.</p>
    <p xml:lang="zh_CN">ComputeSec 是一个基于 GTK4/libadwaita 的桌面小工具，帮助您评估固件安全 (HSI)、内核加固程度、硬件品牌信誉与日常使用习惯，并给出可操作的修复建议。所有检测均在本地完成，不会上传任何数据；对于需要 root 权限的信息，我们会通过分步向导引导您自行执行只读命令并复制结果。</p>
  </description>
