  <releases>
    <release version="1.1.0" date="2026-09-06">
      <description>
        <p>Privacy and accuracy improvements.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Removed the invasive flatpak-spawn (org.freedesktop.Flatpak) permission</li>
          <li>New step-by-step data collection wizard that reads results from the clipboard</li>
          <li>Root-only sysctl values such as vm.mmap_rnd_bits are now reported instead of silently misjudged</li>
          <li>Host OS name and kernel are read over the org.freedesktop.hostname1 D-Bus interface instead of the runtime's /etc/os-release</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
